			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6D05E6DC441E77C2"]
			description: [
				"The Fluid pipe allows you to transfer items from one tank to another at a rate of 50mb every 1 tick."
				""
				"The pipe automatically connects to blocks that can store fluids. By shift right-clicking with any wrench, you can switch it to import mode. Import mode lets the pipe pull from the conneced tank. The fluid will then be exported to the nearest tank connected to the pipe."
				""
				"Can be upgraded and filtered."
			]
