			description: [
				"GT pipes are unique in the way that they do &lNOT&r have their own normal means of pulling from a block. In order to use a pipe, one end must have items (or fluids) &lPUSHED&r into the open end of the pipe. Pushed items will immediatly be brought to the storage at the end of the pipe."
				""
				"Fluid pipes are special in the way that they have an internal buffer"
